{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26147","headline":"送韩将军之鴈门 · 陈去疾","name":"送韩将军之鴈门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒塞峰烟百道驰，鴈门风色暗旌旗。\n破围铁骑长驱疾，饮血将军转战危。\n画角吹开边月静，缦缨不信虏尘窥。\n归来长揖功成後，黄石当年故有期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈去疾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}